{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/28274c9b9154a602319ce4942e9614ea.avif?t=1773732716\" width=612 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic world ravaged by nuclear bombs that have contaminated the planet, altering people's behavior completely, Max is a survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dramatic and terrifying moment, Max manages to protect his wife from malicious individuals and begins an unrelenting search for his young daughter, who was kidnapped by a gang in this devastated world, which has a frightening behavior and way of living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/320a6826982a96f8bbac7c58b5d38b71.poster.avif?t=1773732716\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/320a6826982a96f8bbac7c58b5d38b71.webm?t=1773732716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/320a6826982a96f8bbac7c58b5d38b71.mp4?t=1773732716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max needs to survive in this environment, facing radiation, the heat of the day, the cold of the night, thirst, and hunger. With courage, he'll confront all obstacles and enemies in this new world, trying once again to find meaning in his survival, which is to protect those he loves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a characteristic progression of survival and RPG games, the player will gradually adjust Max's characteristics, increasing his skills and making choices that can change the course of the story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/2fed65680e582094464c7e3c3629c77b.poster.avif?t=1773732716\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/2fed65680e582094464c7e3c3629c77b.webm?t=1773732716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/2fed65680e582094464c7e3c3629c77b.mp4?t=1773732716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the game's unique features, we can highlight: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play in first or third person.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience an open world to explore numerous mysterious and perilous locations.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge alliances or make enemies on your journey, your choices make a difference.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve your character throughout the story to face enemies and terrifying creatures.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use guns and cars to achieve your objectives.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage resources for your survival and take care not to be killed by radiation.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/c2203874d790d3fa97057ff934d379d2.poster.avif?t=1773732716\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/c2203874d790d3fa97057ff934d379d2.webm?t=1773732716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/c2203874d790d3fa97057ff934d379d2.mp4?t=1773732716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max Madness is your next survival, horror, drama, suspense, and adventure game. Dive into a world of madness, where survival is key.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3652470?t=1773732716","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3652470?t=1773732716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/8fbb12d5bd9094daae521cf070b8be1af56491ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773732716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/8fbb12d5bd9094daae521cf070b8be1af56491ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773732716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/28274c9b9154a602319ce4942e9614ea.avif?t=1773732716\" width=612 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic world ravaged by nuclear bombs that have contaminated the planet, altering people's behavior completely, Max is a survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dramatic and terrifying moment, Max manages to protect his wife f